{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13602070","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13602070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1360207001:0":{"text":"소리를 따라 숲으로 향한 우리는 금세 팔라모르를 발견했다.","source_cn":"循着声音在林间穿行，你们很快发现了法拉莫尔的身影。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1A78A78CA0AE9FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1360207002:1":{"text":"팔라모르는 확실히 누군가와 싸우고 있었지만 궁지에 몰린 것은 아니었다. 그리고 우리의 모습을 본 팔라모르는 다소 놀란 것 같았다.","source_cn":"他的确正在战斗，但看起来并非苦战，对于你们的到来，他似...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B596B0062416AE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360207003:1":{"text":"여긴 어떻게 오셨습니까?","source_cn":"你们怎么来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D2312C82A58FA9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360207004:1":{"text":"어? 몬스터 아닌가요? 뭐, 일단 도와드릴게요!","source_cn":"咦，不是魔物？算了，我们先来帮忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C40F4731CCB2E42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"팔라모르","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":